{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fling flying fans at your friends in chaotic multiplayer battles of up to 6 players! Grab spicy powerups, master snappy controls, and fight to be the last one standing in fast-paced rounds set in whimsical, hazard-filled arenas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/TitleLocalMultiplayerMayhem.png?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 6 friends locally, add bots, or play online with Steam Remote Play. Dive into fast-paced free-for-all chaos where only one fighter emerges victorious! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/big_battle.gif?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/TitleQuickCompetitiveRounds.png?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matches feature multiple rounds lasting about 1 minute each for competitive rapid-fire play. Controls are easy to learn, yet snappy and responsive, providing depth and a high skill ceiling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/bite_sized_battles_new.gif?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/TitleSpiceItUpWithPowerups.png?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up round-exclusive powerups mid-battle: torch rivals with Fire Breath, freeze them solid with Ice Ring, transform foes with Mushroom Ring, or protect yourself with Earth Shield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/powerups_new.gif?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/TitleHazardPackedArenas.png?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate dynamic Asian-inspired arenas full of hazards - teleporters, fiery traps, giant mushrooms, and crushing stone hands that twist matches into unpredictable, wild battles.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/hazards_new.gif?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/TitleIntroducingOurMenu.png?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your favorite from dim-sum inspired characters like HarGow the Shrimp Dumpling or BokBok the Bok Choy. They all play the same, but each have their own tasty style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/the_crew_new.gif?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udead Quick, action-packed rounds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd5f Deliciously cute dim sum fighters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26e9\ufe0f Over 20 dynamic arenas with unique hazards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde7 Round-exclusive  powerups </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Easy controls, high skill ceiling  </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shaolin Bao Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862140/0febef5cfa651bf69feac4845b7f74e24311d419.jpg"},{"name":"Shaolin Bao Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st