yer","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fling flying fans at your friends in chaotic multiplayer battles of up to 6 players! Grab spicy powerups, master snappy controls, and fight to be the last one standing in fast-paced rounds set in whimsical, hazard-filled arenas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/TitleLocalMultiplayerMayhem.png?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 6 friends locally, add bots, or play online with Steam Remote Play. Dive into fast-paced free-for-all chaos where only one fighter emerges victorious! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/big_battle.gif?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/TitleQuickCompetitiveRounds.png?t=1744908954\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matches feature multiple rounds lasting about 1 minute each for competitive rapid-fire play. Controls are easy to learn, yet snappy and responsive, providing depth and a high skill ceiling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras